• Translate technical analysis into clear, compelling and commercially relevant recommendations for clients.

• Produce high-quality written outputs, including reports, presentations and briefing materials for senior client stakeholders.

• Contribute to business development activities, including proposal writing, discussions on client propositions, and the development of new service offerings.&nbsp;

• Build trusted relationships with clients and support the delivery of projects from inception through to final recommendations.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Contribute to internal initiatives that strengthen the team's capabilities, analytical tools, intellectual property and market profile.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Stay abreast of emerging policy, regulatory and market developments, identifying implications for clients and opportunities for new work.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;

