Our vision is to give everyone the belief they can make their move. We aim to make moving simpler, by giving everyone the best place to turn to and return to for access to the tools, expertise, trust, and belief to make it happen.

We’re home to the UK’s largest choice of properties and are the go-to destination for millions of people planning their next move, reading the latest industry news, or just browsing what’s on the market.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Location: Milton Keynes (Operating a hybrid model with Tues &amp; Weds in the office)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;

Reporting to: Head of Events &amp; Education

We’re looking for a&nbsp;brilliant content creator and confident presenter who can turn insight into compelling, practical stories that help estate and letting agents win. Experience of the property industry is essential.

This is not a traditional training role. It’s about understanding the property industry, identifying what matters most to agents right now, and bringing those insights to life through engaging content, standout presentations and memorable learning experiences.

You’ll be a key voice of Rightmove in the industry - equally comfortable writing high-impact content, shaping narratives from data and insight, and delivering it on stage, on camera or in a room full of agents.

Working across our seminar programme, events and training platforms, you’ll create and deliver content that doesn’t just inform - it inspires action, helps our partners navigate change, and ultimately drives their business success.

What you’ll be doing &lt

